\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Training diagnostics at episode 37,000. The win rate (dashed blue line) remains at approximately 22\% despite continued training, while Q-values exhibit an upward trend decoupled from performance. The Noisy Net sigma remains at zero throughout, indicating no learned exploration.}}{65}{figure.caption.73}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces AAREN/LSTM training metrics at episode 37,000. The prediction accuracy (orange line) plateaus at approximately 18--22\% after episode 5,000, while gradient norms remain stable, suggesting the module has converged to a local optimum.}}{65}{figure.caption.74}%
